-- The paper's base interpreter, written in the surface.
-- The object type is identified by shape: App is the one constructor
-- with two fields of its own type, so S, K and I are its leaves.  The
-- walker sp, the rebuilder rb, the default step equations stepS/stepK/stepI
-- and the fuel loop are all generated (SURFACE-LANGUAGE-DESIGN.md 6c).
term === S | K | I | App term term
maybe === Nothing | Just term

whnfF := {
  step m = sp m nil stepS stepK stepI
}
